  A leather drum, tooled horn, or drum of earthquake can scare nearby
monsters.  (A tooled horn I know for sure is instant freedom when
engulfed by an air elemental.)  Fire and Ice horns I don't know about.
Scaring looks like a good option for you at this point.

  A wand of polymorph is ideal for when engulfed by an air elemental.
Zap it and break out of the resulting morphed monster.

  If you're short of scrolls of gold detection then wands of secret door
detection may save your life finding the portals on the Elemental
Planes.  Even the Bell of Opening can be used twice for that purpose.

  
